title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/George_Jones_Speech.jpg

# go-to syntax: go-to: main_rally; ful_disrupt if ful_strength > 180 and not ful_banned and not return_to_normalcy

Rallies are a way to send a message to the masses, especially in the lead-up to an election. What is the primary theme of this rally?

- @rally_commonwealth: Spread the ideals of a Cooperative Commonwealth and a genuine economic transformation
- @welfare: Agitate for a more comprehensive welfare-state and purposed public ownership
- @blame_old_line: Target the old-line parties
- @wtb: Support the WTB plan!
- @good_government: Point to our party's record of 'good government'
- @easy_discard

@rally_commonwealth
on-arrival: workers_ccf += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_ccf += 3*(1-dissent) if ccf_socialism > managerial_strength; workers_ccf += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; unemployed_ccf += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; ccf_socialism += 5; left_dissent -= 5; old_middle_ccf -= 3; new_middle_ccf -= 2;

Spreading the gospel of a true Cooperative Commonwealth increases general support for socialism but many are unconvinced that 

@welfare
on-arrival: workers_ccf += 3*(1-dissent); workers_ccf += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_ccf += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_ccf += 4*(1-dissent) if welfare > 1; managerial_strength += 3; managerial_dissent -= 3; labour_dissent -= 3;

Speaking of a strong welfare state certainly inspires the workers but also farmers who are 

@blame_old_line
on-arrival: workers_pcps -= 2; workers_lps -= 2; farmers_pcps -= 2; farmers_lps -= 2; new_middle_pcps -= 2; new_middle_lps -= 2; pcps_relation -= 5

The old-line parties were the old masters of the province. Perhaps it would be good to remind voters of that. 

@wtb
view-if: wtb_adopted = 1
choose-if: return_to_normalcy = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The economic crisis is largely over now, and the public is no longer interested in hearing about it.
on-arrival: wtb_support += 1; workers_ccf += 6*(1-dissent); unemployed_ccf += 6*(1-dissent); farmers_ccf += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_ccf += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_ccf += 3*(1-dissent);

The WTB plan has become a popular rallying cry for our party. The workers are eager to go back to work, and that is exactly what the plan promises.


@good_government
on-arrival: workers_ccf += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_ccf += 1*(1-dissent); new_middle_ccf += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_ccf += 3*(1-dissent);

Everyone likes a responsible government and our party has certainly provided clear and good government over our tenure in office. 
